      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("I should get off the island in case the ethics committee is concerned about a rogue mage. I shall not be dragged back in disgrace! I should be able to reach the town of Llorvin before morning. I can hide there until I can head for the dock. I will need some traveling money for that, so go, my bat friends, and find me some gold!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("It would be good to have even more bats as well. There was a colony in that ruined castle where we practiced conjuring fire, so I will try to find that. The castle was also infested with huge rats as I remember, but I can certainly destroy those. I will have to use ice though, as I never mastered fire."),
          },
          {
